melee-unlocked's player Gecko codes (port/runtime/host/user_gecko.cpp, GPL-2.0-or-later) compiled as a build-time copy (Melee-NX-NetPlay
0.4.7): its host header is frontend/src/gecko_shim/gecko_host_shim.h, and the game's function tables are found on the include path.
Nothing else changes: the native writes of game variables (types 00-06, 08, 10-18, 20-2E, 42-4C, 80-88) as upstream; code
